  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-16T08:23:17.096Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One of the coolest features of the current animation override system is that the fist animation is analog (Meaning you can partially trigger it.)\n\nTying this up to dynamic bones gravity lets you perk ears, raise/lower tails, and trigger fancy analog effects. It's very fun to have full control of your tail!\n\nThis works on all controllers except for the Index! Index controllers are only able to trigger digital animations.\n\nIt'd be nice to have a way to hook up analog animation control, either with analogue fist gestures or by utilizing the new touch pads on the controller!",
